* More than 500 young people are expected at the inaugural Grow Zambia Agenda Summit in Lusaka on November 28, organised by BeRelevant Afrika under the theme ‘#ShowUp: Placing youth at the centre of Zambia’s growth’. The summit’s success will depend on whether it moves beyond rhetoric to concrete commitments.
