## Key Takeaways & Watchpoints

* **FRA funding gap:** With no treasury funds for FRA next season, watch for how government will finance strategic maize reserves ahead of the El Niño – and whether the 1.2 million people at risk of food shortages will actually be protected.
* **IMF programme implementation:** The $1.472 billion ECF staff-level agreement must be approved by the IMF board and prior actions implemented – watch for the board date and any conditionality that could affect social spending.
* **Stadium political chants:** Monitor whether FAZ and ZPL actually sanction clubs and fans for political slogans – the ministry’s directive will be tested at the next high-profile fixture.
